# Editor / IDE
.aider*
.DS_Store

# LaTeX build artifacts
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.nav
